@startuml
actor Guest
participant FE
participant ContentSvc
database DB


Guest -> FE : Click "Giới thiệu/FAQ/Chính sách"
FE -> ContentSvc : getPage(slug)
ContentSvc -> DB : SELECT content WHERE slug
DB --> ContentSvc : html/markdown
ContentSvc --> FE : content
FE --> Guest : Hiển thị trang tĩnh
@enduml